<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fresh loins $4.00-5.00 lower; butts $1.00 higher in light test; sknd.hams 17-20 lbs $5.00 lower, 20-26 lbs generally steady; sdls. bellies steady; lean trimmings steady to $1.00 lower.</p>
<p>Trading slow to moderate,with light demand and mostly moderate offerings, except loins offerings which are heavy.</p>
<p>-USDA</p>
